  "description": "PostgreSQL storage provider for Zetian SMTP Server. Provides enterprise-grade message persistence to PostgreSQL databases with advanced features including JSONB header storage, automatic table partitioning, GIN indexing for full-text search, message compression, and built-in retry logic. Ideal for high-volume environments requiring scalable, open-source database storage with powerful querying capabilities.",
